           ((16.)57-LA-142,1.518HR,DG,641.3,0.474)
           ((17.)58-CE-143,33.03HR,DG,293.3,0.428)
           ((18.)59-PR-146,0.402HR,DG,453.9,0.460)
           ((19.)60-ND-149,1.728HR,DG,211.3,0.259)
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-T) The total uncertainty of the relative
            product yields were estimated taking into account
           . the analysis of time dependences,
           . the scatter of values averaged over individual
             measurements,
           . the interpolated efficiency values and
             nuclear-physical constants.
           The total uncertainty in determining the relative
            yields of 241Am photofission products (<12%).
           (ERR-S,,5.) The statistical uncertainty (<5%).
STATUS     (TABLE,,O.O.Parlag+,J,VAT/I,,(3/163),38,2026) Fig.9
